  "notes": "SessionSifu 3.5.24 implements the stability and performance audit: vault-key continuity, resilient search workers, incremental indexing, accurate portable restore outcomes, background image/OCR work and bounded screenshot buffering. GNOME staging is asynchronous and a watchdog preserves native compositor ownership on timeout. Existing restore pacing and browser-owned recovery are unchanged. Update the GNOME integration and log out/in once. See docs/STABILITY_AUDIT.md for recovery guidance and verification limits."
